{
  "_comment": [
    "The 20 heroes of docs/07-heroes.md, authored verbatim from the doc.",
    "",
    "Stat baselines are level-1, star-0 values (docs/07 §7.0's reference-Warden",
    "indices). HeroLeveling (docs/04 §4.3) scales them at loadout time:",
    "heroBase(lvl) = statAtL1 * (1 + 0.085*(lvl-1)), +12% per star.",
    "",
    "Unlock costs docs/07 states as a bare 'shards' with no number (Sela,",
    "Halden, Ashlin) use the standard 40-shard unlock cost docs/04 §4.3 states",
    "generally ('40 to unlock, then 30/80/180/400/900') rather than an invented",
    "number. Unlock text that says a chapter with no 'shards' word (Torv, Sable,",
    "Lira, Corvin, Vane, Thane) is read literally as a chapter-clear grant, not",
    "as an unstated shard cost — see docs/decisions/0005-hero-unlock-costs.md.",
    "",
    "Every StatModifier value is PER INSTANCE, same convention as boons.json.",
    "Multiplicative channels (see StatChannel.isMultiplicative) rest at 1.0."
